{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A manually merged PR can produce an empty review diff, causing the evaluation to grade the wrong change."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"A repeat review of the same commit can cause a confirmed defect to be omitted from the evaluation."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"secret","trigger":"unusual","reason":"An invalid PR URL containing a registered credential can expose that credential in captured console output."}]}